    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Settlers rushed into Arapaho on its founding day in 1892, with some 400 claims posted by sundown.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arapaho%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first town newspaper launched in 1892 as The Arapahoe Arrow before becoming The Arapahoe Bee.",
